    "title": "On the Journey Together X - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Authors ,\n1 days ago This past week I had the opportunity to worship at Catalina United Methodist Church, where I witnessed three baptisms. There is something deeply moving about standing at the waters of baptism. In a world often focused on decline, scarcity, and uncertainty, baptism reminds us that life is happening in the church. New commitments are being made. New journeys of faith are beginning. God's grace continues to be poured out upon people of every age and stage of life. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
